From 7d096f52b034dd8a64a9142c8cfe8e93cfa28b55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] perf(v2): lazy Merklix arena/disk digests, in-txn node_cache,
 hardware PCLMUL/PMULL GF64, batched P2P/mempool signals, and zero-copy GBT
 state roots

Defer interior Merklix digest recomputation via dirty flags until root
query, add an in-transaction MDBX node_cache, accelerate GF(2^64) syndrome
math with ARM64 PMULL / x86 PCLMULQDQ intrinsics, batch P2P/mempool
notifications, and serve zero-copy state roots in getblocktemplate.
